prompt.template:
Source data for the minibob-cicd dashboard from the impulse state space.

## Data Sources

### 1. Execution Traces
Query: activityExecutionTrace (limit 20, recent first)
Shape needed: trace_list

### 2. Activity Metrics  
Query: activityMetrics (last 24 hours)
Shape needed: activity_metrics

### 3. Specification Compliance
Query: specValidationResult (all specs)
Shape needed: compliance_summary

### 4. System Health
Query: vesselHealth (all registered vessels)
Shape needed: health_status

## Implementation

Use bash/curl to query the Activity API at $ACTIVITY_API_ENDPOINT:
- POST /v2/impulses/resolve for each shape
- Or read from local impulse cache if available

Produce unified dashboard state:
```json
{
  "generated_at": "<ISO timestamp>",
  "generated_by": "render-dashboard-state",
  "views": {
    "traces": {
      "shape": "trace_list",
      "data": { ... }
    },
    "metrics": {
      "shape": "activity_metrics", 
      "data": { ... }
    },
    "compliance": {
      "shape": "compliance_summary",
      "data": { ... }
    },
    "health": {
      "shape": "health_status",
      "data": { ... }
    }
  }
}
```

If any source fails, include error state:
```json
{
  "error": "Failed to resolve",
  "fallback": "cached" | "empty"
}
```

Output to: /tmp/dashboard/state.json
